  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maombi Foundation are developing an android-based app to allow the transmitting of patient symptoms summaries to health centre in Dar-es Salam allowing people in rural areas access to medical expertise. Agreement partner is The Maombi Foundation for Technology In Healthcare, org reg no 802472-8506, Sweden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Maombi Foundation utvecklar en app f&#xf6;r att skicka diagnoser digitalet p&#xe5; symtom till v&#xe5;rdcentraler i Dar-es-Salam. Detta ger m&#xe4;nniskor p&#xe5; landbygden tillg&#xe5;ng till b&#xe4;ttre sjukv&#xe5;rd. Avtalspart &#xe4;r The Maombi Foundation for Technology In Healthcare, org.nr 802472-8506, Sverige.</narrative>
  </description>
